1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:06,614
A letter is more than words on a page. It can be a bill, a deadline, or a
changed appointment.

2
00:00:06,964 --> 00:00:11,332
For blind and low vision people, reading it aloud is only the beginning.

3
00:00:11,682 --> 00:00:17,514
Wayfinder helps manage what comes next, within limits you choose, with a
record you can inspect.

4
00:00:19,214 --> 00:00:27,278
This is the live MCP demo host, running offline with fictional sample
documents. Image reading is off for this recording.

5
00:00:27,628 --> 00:00:35,524
I ask, what's due today? The briefing highlights a water bill, an appointment,
a flagged letter, and an everyday reminder.

6
00:00:37,224 --> 00:00:42,000
The backlog connects related letters into threads and ranks what needs
attention.

7
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:47,630
Three water bill reminders are one outstanding demand, with its deadline and
history.

8
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:53,908
A corrected appointment belongs with the original letter, so outdated
information does not stand alone.

9
00:00:55,608 --> 00:01:00,504
Here, the sample insurance letter has low confidence and needs recapturing.

10
00:01:00,854 --> 00:01:05,702
Wayfinder makes uncertainty visible, instead of guessing at a blurred account
number.

11
00:01:07,402 --> 00:01:12,634
Now I try to discard a document. The user has forbidden that action.

12
00:01:12,984 --> 00:01:19,896
Even after confirmation, the authority check refuses it, explains why, and
offers help from a trusted contact.

13
00:01:20,246 --> 00:01:23,678
The document stays, and the refusal is recorded.

14
00:01:25,378 --> 00:01:32,698
I ask, prove it. Wayfinder recomputes the ledger's hash chain, including the
refusal we just made.

15
00:01:33,048 --> 00:01:37,536
The chain verifies, and its final fingerprint is available to copy.

16
00:01:37,886 --> 00:01:42,950
This is a tamper evident system record, not independent confirmation from a
bank.

17
00:01:44,650 --> 00:01:49,810
The same interface helps with everyday information. Where are my keys?

18
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:55,200
Wayfinder recalls the kitchen counter, the location the user previously
recorded.

19
00:01:56,900 --> 00:02:01,436
The host offers a dark theme, larger text, and motion controls.

20
00:02:01,786 --> 00:02:09,634
Keyboard focus stays visible. Results are available as text and speech, so
important information is not screen only.

21
00:02:11,334 --> 00:02:19,758
Behind the interface is a self hosted MCP server, built with TypeScript and
Node.js, with interactive MCP App views.

22
00:02:20,108 --> 00:02:28,628
Amazon Textract can read new documents when configured. Hosted models and an
implemented Alexa Skill endpoint extend the same core.

23
00:02:30,328 --> 00:02:35,536
Wayfinder turns paperwork into something you can manage, question, and verify.

24
00:02:35,886 --> 00:02:41,766
Greater independence. Clear boundaries. A record you can inspect.
